SCHEMA  = 'SCI_CAL_ImageMetadata.fsd' / filename of schema defining this data stEXT_VER = '13.2    '           / version of the data structure                  DATA_LVL= 'L1      '           / Level of this data product                     PROC_CHN= 'data reduction'     / Processing chain creating this data structure            / L1 product : Metadata of the calibrated images, stored in the same            / FITS file.                                                                    / There is one row per two dimensional image in the associated image            / cube. It stores metadata of that image. This data structure is used           / for subArrays as well as for images of the FullArray. In the latter           / case there will be just one row in the table.                                                                                                       